    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64d838aa87073634a6196846",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……当我回过神，已经有大批记者围过来了。\n她才刚跑完重要的出道战，我想至少要让她\n休息一下，正打算要拒绝的时候……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3c69a00447feaeae3c916419b7d36cd213b4dadb8def8d848eda34be6203f9d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
