      "uid": "zhcn:7b833fe5996be09c0f03556c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是啊，一点问题都没有。\n比赛前我也跟你说过了，\n我们可不能让赢得瞩目的好机会溜走了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "41f83e7fcbbd80e2d206faff5bd043b2de109254b265bb2f2a55f3f2f1a33344",
