      "uid": "zhcn:6283199a24b63908b2aa6482",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当然是以经典三冠为目标前进。\n为此，我必须先在新马级──",
      "source_fingerprint": "150f1683f5831a4310535d5d2272ebff3356f7285eb317bdf7fd56b025e7eba2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
