      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "鲁道夫象征应该视为目标的是经典三冠，\n也就是要走向最高难度的正统路线。",
      "source_fingerprint": "72bf5d6dd9bed87969a962965a44ce5694d010c67bae23bd68b638e9d8705270",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
